00:31:49,430 --> 00:31:51,500
- What will happen to the cure?
- About the medical demonstration...

489
00:31:51,570 --> 00:31:53,840
(The prosecution)

490
00:31:53,900 --> 00:31:56,200
(Guam District Prosecutors' Office)

491
00:31:56,270 --> 00:31:58,210
A medical demonstration?
What is this crap?

492
00:31:58,970 --> 00:32:00,840
The fact that he even revealed
his treatment method...

493
00:32:01,210 --> 00:32:02,680
means he must have something
up his sleeve.

494
00:32:04,110 --> 00:32:05,450
Something up his sleeve?

495
00:32:06,250 --> 00:32:09,350
Are you saying Lee Woo Gyeom can cure
incurable diseases or something?

496
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:11,990
Keep a lid on this.

497
00:32:12,820 --> 00:32:15,960
Prosecutor Cha, you can't let the patient
undergo any other surgery.

498
00:32:16,460 --> 00:32:18,760
If it interferes with the procedure
that I was performing,

499
00:32:19,630 --> 00:32:21,160
he'll never recover.

500
00:32:21,460 --> 00:32:25,200
To be clear, you went to the hospital
only after Lee Woo Gyeom fully cured you?

501
00:32:25,600 --> 00:32:26,600
Yes.

502
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:31,070
Your condition got worse
after resuming treatment at the hospital.

503
00:32:31,870 --> 00:32:33,410
Not because of Lee Woo Gyeom.

504
00:32:38,010 --> 00:32:39,080
About the Lee Woo Gyeom case...

505
00:32:39,450 --> 00:32:40,950
You know it was a shoddy investigation,
right?

506
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:43,890
What? We caught the right guy.

507
00:32:43,950 --> 00:32:46,320
But you had no idea a cure even existed.

508
00:32:46,950 --> 00:32:49,620
Prosecutor Cha,
no one could've predicted that.

509
00:32:50,120 --> 00:32:53,590
Besides, the claim that Lee Woo Gyeom
was curing people...

510
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:57,670
- No one would've believed it.
- That's what makes it shoddy.

511
00:32:57,870 --> 00:32:58,870
What?

512
00:32:58,930 --> 00:33:00,640
An investigation isn't just about
confirming what you believe.

513
00:33:00,700 --> 00:33:03,040
You also have to verify
why something might be false.

514
00:33:03,570 --> 00:33:06,810
The reporters are already sniffing around,
and if I turn my back on you too,

515
00:33:07,280 --> 00:33:09,080
you'll be left high and dry,
Detective Gong.

516
00:33:16,250 --> 00:33:18,020
Prosecutor Cha,

517
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:20,420
You're going to cooperate with me
all the way, right?

518
00:33:21,260 --> 00:33:22,460
Yes, of course.

519
00:33:23,220 --> 00:33:27,330
First, please confirm if there's someone
pulling the strings.

520
00:33:27,460 --> 00:33:29,500
Are you saying he had an accomplice?

521
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:32,300
I don't know if it's an accomplice
or an associate.

522
00:33:32,930 --> 00:33:35,240
It's just that for him to create
the cure or the treatment...

523
00:33:35,570 --> 00:33:37,310
I find it hard to believe
he did it all by himself.

524
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:43,950
Actually, Prosecutor Cha,

525
00:33:50,650 --> 00:33:53,220
This came up while I was reviewing
the CCTV footage from the arrest scene.

526
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:55,890
It's too dark to make out a face, though.

527
00:33:56,460 --> 00:33:59,930
There is another CCTV camera
near the entrance, but it was broken.

528
00:34:00,430 --> 00:34:04,300
I sent the footage to forensics
to be restored. Once we get a face,

529
00:34:04,470 --> 00:34:07,900
I'll start looking into
a possible accomplice as you suggested.

530
00:34:27,020 --> 00:34:29,520
Chief Bang, the visitor logs
for Lee Woo Gyeom...

531
00:34:29,590 --> 00:34:30,860
Please print out the entire list.

532
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:32,990
What date range should I pull?

533
00:34:33,260 --> 00:34:36,730
- It's been a while since he was detained.
- From beginning to end, obviously.

534
00:34:38,200 --> 00:34:39,200
Right.

535
00:34:39,830 --> 00:34:44,210
Please secure all CCTV footage
within 500m of Lee Woo Gyeom's workshop.

536
00:34:44,410 --> 00:34:47,840
- All of it?
- You can request it from Detective Gong.

537
00:34:48,340 --> 00:34:50,510
And pull three years of his
communication records too.

538
00:34:50,580 --> 00:34:52,250
All three years?

539
00:34:54,250 --> 00:34:55,250
Chief Bang.

540
00:34:57,050 --> 00:34:58,050
Chief Bang?

541
00:34:58,990 --> 00:35:00,990
Just until this case is wrapped up,

542
00:35:01,260 --> 00:35:05,390
for the sake of efficiency,
let's talk without any question marks.

543
00:35:07,530 --> 00:35:08,730
Yes, understood.

544
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:12,270
(Total Views: 2,000,035)

545
00:35:12,330 --> 00:35:15,770
We broke two million views!
Man, how long has it been?

546
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:18,210
Hey, this is huge! Huge!
Look at this! It's just shooting up!

547
00:35:20,340 --> 00:35:22,710
But public opinion is like a fad.

548
00:35:23,180 --> 00:35:24,880
You never know when
it's going to flip on you.

549
00:35:25,050 --> 00:35:29,050
Gosh, come on, Counselor.
Don't rain on our parade.

550
00:35:29,120 --> 00:35:31,390
- Goodness.
- Reporter Jo.

551
00:35:31,650 --> 00:35:32,650
Yes.

552
00:35:33,290 --> 00:35:35,320
- You did great work too.
- So did you.

553
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:36,760
Goodness.

554
00:35:39,930 --> 00:35:40,930
By the way...

555
00:35:42,230 --> 00:35:44,370
When Lee Woo Gyeom was arrested,

556
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:46,000
could he and Prosecutor Cha...

557
00:35:46,670 --> 00:35:48,500
have possibly struck a deal?

558
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,070
No, there's no way.

559
00:35:52,310 --> 00:35:55,480
What if the Prosecution knew
about Lee Woo Gyeom's ability...

560
00:35:56,410 --> 00:35:58,050
before we did?

561
00:36:00,410 --> 00:36:03,050
You're thinking about
the missing evidence.

562
00:36:03,520 --> 00:36:04,520
That's right.

563
00:36:05,190 --> 00:36:08,020
And of all things, it had to be
his research notebook.

564
00:36:08,290 --> 00:36:10,390
But if the Prosecution already knew,

565
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:12,860
would they have handled
the trial that way?

566
00:36:13,790 --> 00:36:14,800
Right, that's a good point.

567
00:36:16,230 --> 00:36:17,230
In that case...

568
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,400
Besides the Prosecution...

569
00:36:20,500 --> 00:36:22,270
Does that mean
there's someone else involved?

570
00:36:23,500 --> 00:36:26,170
Lee Woo Gyeom woke up from a coma, right?

571
00:36:26,470 --> 00:36:29,640
Shouldn't there be someone who knew
about his physical condition back then?

572
00:36:34,820 --> 00:36:38,650
My doctor said my blood showed a different
mutational response than before, but...

573
00:36:39,550 --> 00:36:41,360
I couldn't just take his word for it.

574
00:36:42,290 --> 00:36:44,890
I was just an ordinary medical student,
after all.

575
00:36:53,770 --> 00:36:54,770
(Medical Report: Lee Woo Gyeom)

576
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,440
(Clinic: Chaeum Clinic)

577
00:36:57,510 --> 00:36:59,810
(Physician: Han Sang Ho)

578
00:37:06,910 --> 00:37:07,920
Hello?

579
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:10,720
Yes. Is this Professor Han?

580
00:37:12,950 --> 00:37:15,660
Yes. I'm representing Mr. Lee Woo Gyeom.

581
00:37:16,290 --> 00:37:17,660
My name is Attorney Park Han Jun.

582
00:37:18,460 --> 00:37:19,960
I apologize for the sudden call,

583
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:22,060
but I had something I needed to ask you.

584
00:37:22,930 --> 00:37:26,930
By any chance,
when Lee Woo Gyeom fell into a coma,

585
00:37:28,240 --> 00:37:30,070
you were in charge of his care, correct?

586
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:34,510
- This is nice.
- The weather's great.

587
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,940
- Hey.
- Yes?

588
00:37:37,010 --> 00:37:39,650
(Moral Cultivation)

589
00:37:39,750 --> 00:37:41,580
Hey, isn't that the guy?

590
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:44,120
They say he only targeted and killed guys
with criminal records.

591
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:46,150
Goodness. That's brutal.

592
00:37:46,620 --> 00:37:48,320
He only hunted down and killed
guys like us?

593
00:37:48,820 --> 00:37:51,960
- You punk? What do you mean "like us?"
- Hey, you fool!

594
00:37:52,490 --> 00:37:53,490
You little...

595
00:37:54,090 --> 00:37:56,900
Have you lost your darn mind
because I haven't beaten you up lately?

596
00:37:57,500 --> 00:37:58,500
I'm sorry.

597
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:03,500
He's getting on my nerves.

598
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:09,510
So annoying.
I can't stand that look on his face.

599
00:38:53,690 --> 00:38:54,690
Professor Han.

600
00:38:55,420 --> 00:38:56,860
I was told you discovered...

601
00:38:57,930 --> 00:39:00,090
a mutation in Lee Woo Gyeom's blood.

602
00:39:00,660 --> 00:39:01,860
It was just speculation,

603
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:03,730
not a definitive diagnosis.

604
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,800
So then,

605
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:07,870
are you saying...

606
00:39:08,900 --> 00:39:10,300
Lee Woo Gyeom's cure is unstable?

607
00:39:10,640 --> 00:39:11,670
Of course.

608
00:39:12,670 --> 00:39:16,010
Administering it to a human subject
was impossible.

609
00:39:17,310 --> 00:39:18,550
Lee Woo Gyeom said...

610
00:39:20,250 --> 00:39:22,150
that to ensure its stability,

611
00:39:23,250 --> 00:39:26,120
he decided to run experiments,
and in the process...

612
00:39:27,120 --> 00:39:28,890
That's how there came to be victims.

613
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:33,690
Counselor,
do you really think that's possible?

614
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:36,160
Pardon?

615
00:39:36,730 --> 00:39:38,970
The blood therapy
that Woo Gyeom mentioned...

616
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:41,770
hasn't even made it to clinical trials.

617
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,700
For one medical student,

618
00:39:44,270 --> 00:39:45,310
all on his own,

619
00:39:45,940 --> 00:39:47,510
to create a viable treatment...

620
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:50,180
Do you honestly believe that's possible?

621
00:39:50,940 --> 00:39:51,950
Still,

622
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:55,250
I heard there was someone
who received the treatment.

623
00:39:57,020 --> 00:39:58,020
That's a lie.

624
00:39:59,690 --> 00:40:00,690
It's impossible.

625
00:40:04,590 --> 00:40:07,590
(Cheongun-ro 45-1)

626
00:40:42,260 --> 00:40:44,600
Yes, I've just checked it.

627
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:45,670
(National Forensic Service)

628
00:40:48,670 --> 00:40:49,670
Right.

629
00:40:59,250 --> 00:41:00,280
(At this time,)

630
00:41:00,350 --> 00:41:02,450
(based on the suspect's blood sample,)

631
00:41:02,520 --> 00:41:04,150
(the "unique healing properties"
cannot be scientifically proven).

632
00:41:04,220 --> 00:41:06,650
Prosecutor.
Your sentencing recommendation, please.

633
00:41:07,420 --> 00:41:08,820
(Prosecution)

634
00:41:09,490 --> 00:41:10,490
Your Honor.

635
00:41:11,390 --> 00:41:13,030
While the focus of this hearing...

636
00:41:13,660 --> 00:41:15,400
may be to establish a motive,

637
00:41:16,060 --> 00:41:18,700
the defendant brutally murdered 17 people,

638
00:41:19,200 --> 00:41:22,600
and he is a serial killer
who shows not a shred of remorse.

639
00:41:23,940 --> 00:41:25,470
That is something we must never forget.

640
00:41:26,710 --> 00:41:27,780
We will now state our recommendation.

641
00:41:29,080 --> 00:41:30,080
The prosecution,

642
00:41:30,680 --> 00:41:35,620
contrary to claims, finds his blood has
only a negligible effect as a treatment...

643
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:39,190
and is unsafe for therapeutic use,
according to the NFS.

644
00:41:39,950 --> 00:41:42,090
For the heinous criminal, Lee Woo Gyeom,

645
00:41:43,260 --> 00:41:44,430
we demand the death penalty.

646
00:41:53,500 --> 00:41:55,840
Counsel, you may present
your closing argument.

647
00:42:01,210 --> 00:42:02,210
Your Honor.

648
00:42:03,510 --> 00:42:06,050
Establishing motive reveals
the reason for a crime...

649
00:42:06,110 --> 00:42:08,980
and is a crucial step
in determining the sentence.

650
00:42:10,180 --> 00:42:12,720
However, the prosecution...

651
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:14,760
has ignored this fact...

652
00:42:15,990 --> 00:42:17,860
and tried to pigeonhole the defendant,
Lee Woo Gyeom,

653
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:21,700
as a random serial killer.

654
00:42:22,900 --> 00:42:23,900
In the past, the defendant...

655
00:42:24,930 --> 00:42:27,400
lived in constant pain
as the victim of a car accident,

656
00:42:28,470 --> 00:42:32,470
and we learned he committed these crimes
while developing a treatment...

657
00:42:33,140 --> 00:42:35,510
for patients suffering just as he was.

658
00:42:36,010 --> 00:42:40,510
Contrary to the NFS opinion
submitted by the prosecution,

659
00:42:41,350 --> 00:42:43,220
we have a report from the
American Blood Association...

660
00:42:44,120 --> 00:42:46,420
suggesting that defendant Lee Woo Gyeom's
treatment...

661
00:42:46,920 --> 00:42:48,820
could have been beneficial
to the witnesses.

662
00:42:49,290 --> 00:42:50,290
Thus, we ask not for the death penalty,

663
00:42:50,690 --> 00:42:55,260
but for the most lenient sentence.
Lastly, to be considered in your judgment,

664
00:42:56,360 --> 00:42:58,230
we request a medical demonstration.

665
00:43:00,270 --> 00:43:01,270
The defense rests.

666
00:43:17,180 --> 00:43:20,820
Sentencing will be held at a later date.

667
00:43:33,900 --> 00:43:37,270
Min Seo, how about we go out
with Dad this weekend?

668
00:43:41,340 --> 00:43:42,340
Min Seo.

669
00:43:45,450 --> 00:43:46,450
Min Seo.

670
00:43:49,920 --> 00:43:50,920
Min Seo?

671
00:43:51,790 --> 00:43:53,820
Mom, I'm sleepy.

672
00:43:56,060 --> 00:43:57,060
You are.

673
00:43:57,690 --> 00:44:00,090
Let's lie down. Okay, up we go.

674
00:44:12,670 --> 00:44:14,510
Gosh, I'm gonna get a heat rash from this.

675
00:44:15,680 --> 00:44:19,150
Darn. This is no day
to be working outside.

676
00:44:20,050 --> 00:44:21,050
Goodness.

677
00:44:21,680 --> 00:44:22,680
Gosh, look at all this sweat.

678
00:44:25,490 --> 00:44:27,590
Man, it's so damn hard to make a living.

679
00:44:28,820 --> 00:44:29,820
Goodness.

680
00:44:31,630 --> 00:44:32,630
Man, this is exhausting.

681
00:44:46,040 --> 00:44:48,340
(Defendant)

682
00:44:54,580 --> 00:44:55,580
Before I deliver the sentence,

683
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:59,290
regarding the conflicting analysis results
presented by both sides,

684
00:44:59,890 --> 00:45:02,220
my judgment was based on what is in
the public's best interest.

685
00:45:03,460 --> 00:45:06,560
This decision was not based on
the treatment analysis alone,

686
00:45:06,990 --> 00:45:09,130
but on the facts revealed
over the course of the trial,

687
00:45:09,660 --> 00:45:10,900
the defendant's attitude,

688
00:45:11,400 --> 00:45:14,330
and the consistency of the testimonies.

689
00:45:16,200 --> 00:45:17,470
I will now deliver the sentence.

690
00:45:18,070 --> 00:45:21,680
The defense has argued
that the defendant...

691
00:45:22,080 --> 00:45:26,480
created and administered a treatment
in an attempt to save sick people.

692
00:45:26,880 --> 00:45:28,280
In reviewing this argument,

693
00:45:29,120 --> 00:45:33,120
based on analysis of the genetic variant
found in the defendant's blood...

694
00:45:39,560 --> 00:45:42,460
The verdict in the first trial
of killer Lee Woo Gyeom...

695
00:45:42,460 --> 00:45:44,000
is about to be announced.

696
00:45:44,060 --> 00:45:45,500
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

697
00:45:45,570 --> 00:45:47,470
- He looks like someone who lives here.
- Does he?

698
00:45:48,170 --> 00:45:49,170
Thank you.

699
00:45:50,200 --> 00:45:51,300
Citing the American
Blood Association's opinion...

700
00:45:51,810 --> 00:45:54,810
that this mutated blood
is a significant factor...

701
00:45:55,180 --> 00:45:56,580
in proving his treatment hypothesis...

702
00:45:57,310 --> 00:45:59,710
and can affect the treatment of diseases,

703
00:45:59,880 --> 00:46:02,420
the court has taken this into account.

704
00:46:03,080 --> 00:46:05,420
The court accepts that
his motive for the crime...

705
00:46:05,820 --> 00:46:08,160
was to treat sick people.

706
00:46:13,690 --> 00:46:16,200
Breaking news. In the final verdict
of the first-instance trial,

707
00:46:16,260 --> 00:46:18,930
the court has accepted
Lee Woo Gyeom's motive for the crime.

708
00:46:21,500 --> 00:46:22,640
This was hard to get.

709
00:46:31,210 --> 00:46:33,080
Lee Woo Gyeom killed my brother?

710
00:46:38,050 --> 00:46:40,520
The court accepts that
his motive for the crime...

711
00:46:40,920 --> 00:46:43,360
- was to treat sick people.
- Right?

712
00:46:44,260 --> 00:46:46,730
However, Lee Woo Gyeom's blood...

713
00:46:47,230 --> 00:46:50,360
is far too unsafe
to be used as a treatment,

714
00:46:50,600 --> 00:46:55,340
and as the NFS deems it inadmissible
as evidence of his treatments,

715
00:46:55,570 --> 00:46:59,840
this court,
while acknowledging his motive,

716
00:47:00,210 --> 00:47:04,950
cannot accept the claim
that he actually cured the witnesses.

717
00:47:05,480 --> 00:47:06,480
Goodness.

718
00:47:08,880 --> 00:47:09,880
Anyone here?

719
00:47:22,230 --> 00:47:23,230
Darn it...

720
00:47:26,130 --> 00:47:30,370
Therefore, the defense's request,
a medical demonstration is denied,

721
00:47:30,870 --> 00:47:33,210
and the defendant is sentenced
to the maximum penalty allowed by law,

722
00:47:34,140 --> 00:47:35,710
the death penalty.

723
00:47:43,320 --> 00:47:45,320
(Defendant)

724
00:48:09,380 --> 00:48:11,340
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
